+caption: Pinned tabs
+desc: |-
+  Keeps a list of URLs open as pinned tabs in every <ph name="PRODUCT_NAME">$1<ex>Google Chrome</ex></ph> window.
+
+  When a window opens, and whenever this policy changes, each URL without a pinned tab of the same host (ignoring a leading "www.") is opened as a pinned tab, after the existing pinned tabs. Navigating inside such a tab doesn't open a duplicate. Users can still close or unpin these tabs; they come back in the next window.
+
+  Incognito and guest windows are not affected.
+
+  If this policy is not set, no tabs are pinned automatically.
+example_value:
+- https://www.youtube.com/
+- https://www.twitch.tv/
+features:
+  dynamic_refresh: true
+  per_profile: true
+owners:
+- file://components/policy/OWNERS
+schema:
+  items:
+    type: string
+  type: array
+supported_on:
+- chrome.linux:156-
+- chrome.win:156-
+- chrome.mac:156-
+tags: []
+type: list
